      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the overwhelming pain in your words, and it is painful that you feel forced to trust evidence that hurts over hope that feels fragile. When the self is the only source of \"data,\" the conclusion of total failure can feel mathematically undeniable, but hope is a human tool that allows us to continue learning and growing despite a start. Your value as a person is not calculated by a 6-year financial outcome or a decoding of \"entropy.\"",
